        <footnote id="F3">The number of derivative securities beneficially owned following the reported transaction includes 4,934 RSUs remaining from the April 27, 2026 grant described in footnote 1 and 2,104 RSUs remaining from the 2,806 RSUs granted to the reporting person on June 3, 2026 under the issuer's 2025 Incentive Compensation Plan as a supplemental award in respect of the annual bonus under Section 3(b) of the reporting person's Executive Employment Agreement, previously reported on the reporting person's Form 4 filed on June 8, 2026 and the reporting person's Form 4/A filed on October 2, 2026. The June 3, 2026 RSUs vest in four substantially equal quarterly installments (subject to rounding) on each of September 3, 2026, December 3, 2026, March 3, 2027 and June 3, 2027, subject to continued employment on each vesting date.</footnote>
